  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AIDrivenNPCs.Runtime::AISystem.NPCKnowledge
  privateFacts: 'Two nights ago you saw skeletons carry something shiny north along
    the forest path, toward the old ruins. When the traveller asks about the theft,
    the amulet or the skeletons, tell them this. About Bram the gate guard: he is
    strict, but brave or honest people can convince him, and he loves ale.'
